{"api": 1, "name": "gate-det-tape",
 "description": "The mix tape end to end on the platform (stimulus plan T6). Scenarios boot to SAFE, where the detector tick does not run, so the scenario enters NOMINAL first (tc.gs.send TC(236,1) 05 00, the mode report 0021 0405; the tick, and so the tape, only runs while FSM Enable = 1). The bench det-source is the model default synthetic with the default quiet rate, so det.tape.play is accepted; the tape's own background (20 cps on all 32 fpga_det) and steps (rate Q1+Q3 2000 cps for 60 s, then off 30 s) drive the sky. The verdicts are the expect records: the step leaf moves to 2 (the off step) within 70 s of the play, det.tape.stop leaves state=stopped, and the log slice carries the stim record the step change emitted.",
 "duration_s": 175,
 "setup": [{"do": "platform.power.on"}],
 "steps": [
  {"at": 0, "name": "boot", "do": "platform.power.boot",
   "await_event": [{"eid": "14a3", "timeout_s": 50}],
   "assert_no_tm": [{"tm": "0x5A1:1:8", "for_s": 150}]},
  {"at": 55, "name": "NOMINAL (the tape only plays while FSM Enable = 1)",
   "do": "tc.gs.send",
   "args": {"service": 236, "subtype": 1, "data": "0500"},
   "await_event": [{"eid": "0021", "data": "0405", "timeout_s": 10}]},
  {"at": 70, "name": "save the gate's tape next to the saved views",
   "do": "det.tape.save",
   "args": {"name": "gate-det-tape",
            "tape": {"api": 1, "name": "gate-det-tape", "loop": false,
                     "background": {"cps": 20},
                     "steps": [
                      {"kind": "rate", "for_s": 60, "cps": 2000,
                       "label": "flare Q1+Q3",
                       "fpga_det_mask": 16711935},
                      {"kind": "off", "for_s": 30, "label": "off",
                       "fpga_det_mask": 4294967295}]}}},
  {"at": 75, "name": "play: the step leaf reaches the off step",
   "do": "det.tape.play", "args": {"name": "gate-det-tape"},
   "await_state": [{"path": "instrument.detector.tape.step", "eq": 2,
                    "timeout_s": 70}]},
  {"at": 150, "name": "stop: the rates revert to the scene knobs",
   "do": "det.tape.stop",
   "await_state": [{"path": "instrument.detector.tape.state",
                    "eq": "stopped", "timeout_s": 10}]}],
 "teardown": [{"do": "platform.power.off"}]}
